F_note
"On a frustrated plaquette the label weight is (-1)^{2j} w_j: NOT a positive sequence, so log-concavity / Lorentzian / M-convexity has no referent at all -- not merely a false hypothesis. The (NA) measure is frustrated by definition, so the label-space measure it would need does not exist."
